endobj

156 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H6/P 1131 0 R/T(Journalists of the Press Corps are expected to report and write various types of articles that summarise and analyse the proceedings of the committees in a MUN conference.)/E(Journalists of the Press Corps are expected to report and write various types of articles that summarise and analyse the proceedings of the committees in a MUN conference.)/Pg 11 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj

157 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H6/P 1132 0 R/T(IPC journalists are also expected to write editorials and investigative or opinion-based pieces reflecting different perspectives on global issues.)/E(IPC journalists are also expected to write editorials and investigative or opinion-based pieces reflecting different perspectives on global issues.)/Pg 11 0 R/K[7]>>
endobj

158 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H6/P 1133 0 R/T(The Press Corps also incorporates multimedia content, including photos and caricatures, curated by photojournalists and caricaturists.)/E(The Press Corps also incorporates multimedia content, including photos and caricatures, curated by photojournalists and caricaturists.)/Pg 11 0 R/K[8]>>
endobj

159 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 1134 0 R/E(IPC journalists may also be tasked to conduct press conferences or interviews where they can question delegates on their policies and statements made during committee proceedings.)/Pg 11 0 R/K[9]>>
