161 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 95 0 R/E(Additionally, the IPC represents journalists in negotiations with the UN Secretariat to raise concerns of global significance. These journalists cover events across the United Nations' various organizations and committees, as well as participate in press conferences with UN officials and diplomats.)/Pg 11 0 R/K[11]>>
endobj

162 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 95 0 R/E(As a global body of journalists, broadcasters, and publications, the IPC has the principal authority to monitor the proceedings of UN conferences, questioning those in power about their stances and policies, and holding them accountable for their actions.)/Pg 11 0 R/K[12]>>
endobj

163 0 obj
