190 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 96 0 R/E(While writing, all the reporters must be unbiased and maintain a neutral stance throughout, yet they should understand the political position of their allotted news agency and their editorial guidelines, which will help them effectively write Opinion-Editorial articles on different agendas. )/Pg 12 0 R/K[10]>>
endobj

191 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 96 0 R/E(The first task that the reporters of IPC are expected to do is to conduct thorough research on their designated news outlet, including its editorial guidelines, political stance, position on each committee's agenda, and other significant analyses. subsequently, Reporters are expected to curate formal reports about their allotted committees while adhering to their outlet\220s stances, leanings and guidelines.)/Pg 12 0 R/K[11]>>
