214 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H6/P 97 0 R/T(In this category, Journalists are tasked with gathering, evaluating, producing, and disseminating unbiased, factual information. A category within such kind of journalism involves writing \215Beat Reports\216, also known as Specialized Reports, which focus on in-depth reporting and coverage of a specific issue, topic, or situation, emphasizing knowledge, research, and observation over opinions. Beat reports maintain objectivity by focusing on the main idea or topic with exclusive coverage. Such reports convey information without any additional commentary or input from the journalist, making them one of the most significant articles in any conference)/E(In this category, Journalists are tasked with gathering, evaluating, producing, and disseminating unbiased, factual information. A category within such kind of journalism involves writing \215Beat Reports\216, also known as Specialized Reports, which focus on in-depth reporting and coverage of a specific issue, topic, or situation, emphasizing knowledge, research, and observation over opinions. Beat reports maintain objectivity by focusing on the main idea or topic with exclusive coverage. Such reports convey information without any additional commentary or input from the journalist, making them one of the most significant articles in any conference)/Pg 13 0 R/K[7]>>
endobj

215 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H6/P 97 0 R/T(Review Journalism is a combination of both opinions and facts. It is a report/article on a specific topic which also includes the reporter's perspective and opinions. It has its disposition essence. This type of journalism retains the essence of both personal opinion and objectivity, providing readers with a dual view that incorporates factual information alongside the journalist's viewpoint.)/E(Review Journalism is a combination of both opinions and facts. It is a report/article on a specific topic which also includes the reporter's perspective and opinions. It has its disposition essence. This type of journalism retains the essence of both personal opinion and objectivity, providing readers with a dual view that incorporates factual information alongside the journalist's viewpoint.)/Pg 13 0 R/K[8]>>
endobj

216 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H6/P 97 0 R/T(On a specific day of the conference, The IPC will hold press conferences or/and interviews in committees, allowing journalists to question delegates about their stance on the committee agenda. This simulation concentrates on topics that were not properly discussed during the committee sessions, as well as inaccuracies or unusual occurrences. For future reference, journalists may get tasked to collaborate on a joint report of the press conference/interviews.)/E(On a specific day of the conference, The IPC will hold press conferences or/and interviews in committees, allowing journalists to question delegates about their stance on the committee agenda. This simulation concentrates on topics that were not properly discussed during the committee sessions, as well as inaccuracies or unusual occurrences. For future reference, journalists may get tasked to collaborate on a joint report of the press conference/interviews.)/Pg 13 0 R/K[9]>>
