<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 99 0 R/E(A committee report provides a general overview of the committee session's events. This can include a brief exploration of the agenda, the delegates and their stances, the caucus discussions, any important dialogue or statement, or event that takes place in the committee session. A committee report presents information as it is and doesn't include the personal opinions of the reporter.)/Pg 15 0 R/K[7]>>
endobj

266 0 obj
