<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 99 0 R/E(A beat-based article is a genre of journalism focused on a particular issue, sector, organization, or institution over time. It doesn't include the opinions of the reporters and focuses on the factual details and happenings of the committee session, like a committee report. However, unlike a committee report, the reporter has the liberty to find their own "beat", that is, any specific event or topic of discussion in the committee they wish to report on and elaborate on. )/Pg 15 0 R/K[11]>>
