316 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 101 0 R/E(THE FOLLOWING SAMPLES ARE AWARD-WINNING SUBMISSIONS FROM JOURNALISTS AT MUN CONFERENCES ACROSS THE NORTH-EAST CIRCUIT, THEY SERVE AS  VALUABLE REFERENCE FOR FELLOW JOURNALISTS TO UNDERSTAND THE TYPES OF ARTICLES EXPECTED DURING THE CONFERENCE. WE PLACE A STRONG EMPHASIS ON THE SIGNIFICANCE OF JOURNALISTIC INTEGRITY AND UPHOLD A STRICT ZERO-TOLERANCE POLICY AGAINST ANY FORM OF PLAGIARISM.)/Pg 17 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj

317 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/P 101 0 R/T(BEAT REPORT)/E(BEAT REPORT)/Pg 17 0 R/K[7]>>
endobj

