419 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 105 0 R/E(In the 21st century, it has been seen by those in power as more necessary than ever to control the narrative to assimilate more power and prestige, for he who wins the war writes the pow history. This can be elaborated by taking a look at how too many false narratives have shaped the distorted image of the longstanding Israel-Palestine conflict, described by many as not only a geopolitical but also a narrative struggle.Notably, Palestine ranks 157th out of 180 in the 2024 World Press Freedom Index, while Israel, previously leading in the Middle East, was surpassed by Qatar in 2024. RSF stated, "Four of the world's ten most frequent jailers of journalists are in the region: Israel, Saudi Arabia, Syria, and Iran.")/Pg 21 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj

420 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H6/P 105 0 R/T(Social media has fueled the conflict by spreading biased, AI-generated, or misleading images and videos. These posts often misrepresent the actuality, exacerbating tensions between the sides. To put across one example to tell the story of many more- in early 2024, a WhatsApp voice memo claiming insider information spread across Israel, warning civilians of an unprecedented battle and loss of food, water, and internet for a week. Israelis rushed to banks and stores, anticipating an attack.)/E(Social media has fueled the conflict by spreading biased, AI-generated, or misleading images and videos. These posts often misrepresent the actuality, exacerbating tensions between the sides. To put across one example to tell the story of many more- in early 2024, a WhatsApp voice memo claiming insider information spread across Israel, warning civilians of an unprecedented battle and loss of food, water, and internet for a week. Israelis rushed to banks and stores, anticipating an attack.)/Pg 21 0 R/K[7]>>
endobj

421 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H6/P 105 0 R/T(However, hours later, the army clarified on X that the message was false. Additionally, social media has passed off violent, gory images from games or films as real, alongside fake White House memos about aid to Israel, misleading and exacerbating tensions with no factual basis.)/E(However, hours later, the army clarified on X that the message was false. Additionally, social media has passed off violent, gory images from games or films as real, alongside fake White House memos about aid to Israel, misleading and exacerbating tensions with no factual basis.)/Pg 21 0 R/K[8]>>
endobj

422 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H6/P 105 0 R/T(Misinformation is not, however, restricted to only individuals on social media, for it is controlled largely by state-owned media. The conflict for Chinese state-owned media meant leaning into using the crisis to scapegoat Washington as the driver for the conflict and all instability in the Middle East, sidelining the tragic news of four Chinese nationals getting killed, six getting injured, and two going missing due to them, something that received little attention online.)/E(Misinformation is not, however, restricted to only individuals on social media, for it is controlled largely by state-owned media. The conflict for Chinese state-owned media meant leaning into using the crisis to scapegoat Washington as the driver for the conflict and all instability in the Middle East, sidelining the tragic news of four Chinese nationals getting killed, six getting injured, and two going missing due to them, something that received little attention online.)/Pg 21 0 R/K[9]>>
endobj

423 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H6/P 105 0 R/T(On the other end, for the Russian State-Owned Media, it was Zelenskyy who served as the 'Nazi' middleman to serve arms to the Israeli government. Such news helps serve as a rationalization for the national media to justify wrongdoing committed by their government if they ever recognize any.)/E(On the other end, for the Russian State-Owned Media, it was Zelenskyy who served as the 'Nazi' middleman to serve arms to the Israeli government. Such news helps serve as a rationalization for the national media to justify wrongdoing committed by their government if they ever recognize any.)/Pg 21 0 R/K[10]>>
endobj

424 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H6/P 105 0 R/T(To say that there is much to tackle the spread of propaganda and misinformation in this generation of readily available 'information' is hard to say. But, if we can do anything, it is to become aware of how to spot misinformation. A simple way is to follow the methodology to to y to conduct open-source research, as prescribed by Human Rights Watch - Discover, Document, Preserve, Verify, and Analyze. It may seem brittle, but so does propaganda for the one who ably recognizes)/E(To say that there is much to tackle the spread of propaganda and misinformation in this generation of readily available 'information' is hard to say. But, if we can do anything, it is to become aware of how to spot misinformation. A simple way is to follow the methodology to to y to conduct open-source research, as prescribed by Human Rights Watch - Discover, Document, Preserve, Verify, and Analyze. It may seem brittle, but so does propaganda for the one who ably recognizes)/Pg 21 0 R/K[11]>>
endobj

