<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 107 0 R/E(\215A warlord of disgrace, killing all without trace,)/Pg 23 0 R/K[22]>>
endobj

481 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 107 0 R/E(yet in his end, my strength I made him taste.\216)/Pg 23 0 R/K[23]>>
endobj

482 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 107 0 R/E("Same for me, agent," the reporter there exclaimed! )/Pg 23 0 R/K[24]>>
endobj

483 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 107 0 R/E("How possible? like me are you a beast, maybe a fox who is tamed?)/Pg 23 0 R/K[25]>>
endobj

484 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 107 0 R/E("Quite the opposite,\216 the journalist said back.  )/Pg 23 0 R/K[26]>>
endobj

485 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 107 0 R/E( "Now go away, before we push you into the rack." )/Pg 23 0 R/K[27]>>
endobj

486 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 107 0 R/E(At lunch, no martinis, only diplomas with their coffee.)/Pg 23 0 R/K[28]>>
endobj

487 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 107 0 R/E(The delegate's buzzing about this and that. )/Pg 23 0 R/K[29]>>
endobj

488 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 107 0 R/E("How do you handle stakes so high?"  )/Pg 23 0 R/K[30]>>
endobj

489 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 107 0 R/E("In my work, it's to outplay the sly." )/Pg 23 0 R/K[31]>>
endobj

490 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 107 0 R/E(Be the agent or the diplo\220, like poker\204 Know when to hold. )/Pg 23 0 R/K[32]>>
endobj

491 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 107 0 R/E(They both face stakes as high and bold. )/Pg 23 0 R/K[33]>>
