endobj

521 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 108 0 R/E(Reporter - To the delegate of Russia, the delegate had, in their speech in the moderated caucus, condemned the building of the American embassy in Jerusalem, and the American support towards the Israelis. why does the delegate feel the Israelis are undeserving of American support, when they themselves, have, on numerous occasions, stated Israel as a major ally?)/Pg 24 0 R/K[9]>>
endobj

522 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 108 0 R/E( The delegate of Russia - Although we do not condemn the alliance of the US with Israel, Russia as well is an ally of Israel on economic grounds, however, ma\220am, we do not support the United States building a US embassy, particularly in Jerusalem. Why ma\220am? Because international law clearly states that Jerusalem is supposed to be a common capital for Israel and Palestine, and the United States are not only the United States of America, it is a P5 nation, and them building an embassy just for Israel in Jerusalem, it may further instigate a conflict because they have not done so for Palestine.)/Pg 24 0 R/K[10]>>
endobj

523 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 108 0 R/E(Reporter - To the delegate of Kuwait, just after the Gulf War, Kuwait had enforced the exodus of 200,000 Palestinians from the state. Yet the delegate had called out for peace in their speech and said it is of utmost importance that the world is united in support of Palestine. What does the delegate have to say about this?)/Pg 24 0 R/K[11]>>
endobj

524 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 108 0 R/E(The delegate of Kuwait - All I want to say is that we support peace and even though we had past instances when Palestinians were deported, like you)/Pg 24 0 R/K[12]>>
endobj

525 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 108 0 R/E(said, but that was when Iraq had occupied Kuwait, at that time, the Palestinian government had taken the side of the Iraqi government, because of that, the population of Palestinians living in Kuwait were not happy and were displeased the actions, but that was all in the past, the Kuwaiti government stand with the Palestinian brothers and sisters because all they want is peace in the Middle East and an end to this conflict.)/Pg 24 0 R/K[13]>>
endobj

