575 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 110 0 R/E(One must start their articles divergingly, wherein the space they cover increases with each line, and they add more and more details and facts. Furthermore, one must also know how to catch the attention of a person with the article's opening line and headline, which serve as key components in getting one's attention towards reading an article. Furthermore, the articles shall have a minimum of three paragraphs, wherein, the first one is the introduction, the second one serves as the body, and the third one is a conclusion. )/Pg 26 0 R/K[5]>>
endobj

576 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 110 0 R/E(The body can be divided into multiple parts, but, the different paragraphs of the body shall not be interlinked, i.e. the quotation of a delegate/elaboration of a topic shall discontinue at the end of the paragraph. A new one as such shall continue from the next paragraph \(only in case of multiple paragraphs in a body\). Additionally, the articles shall end in a convergingly manner.)/Pg 26 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj

