<</Title(To uphold their role as global media, freedom of the press becomes a fundamental liberty for its existence, which has now been jeopardized due to several factors, including the emergence of biased and sensationalized "yellow journalism". Other factors include government and public hostility towards members of the press, media manipulation by propagandists, state-sanctioned restrictions to access information, lack of protection, and threats to their lives.)/Dest[10 0 R/Fit]/Parent 1219 0 R/First 1502 0 R/Last 1502 0 R/Count -1>>
endobj

