1653 0 obj
<</Title(In this category, Journalists are tasked with gathering, evaluating, producing, and disseminating unbiased, factual information. A category within such kind of journalism involves writing \215Beat Reports\216, also known as Specialized Reports, which focus on in-depth reporting and coverage of a specific issue, topic, or situation, emphasizing knowledge, research, and observation over opinions. Beat reports maintain objectivity by focusing on the main idea or topic with exclusive coverage. Such reports convey information without any additional commentary or input from the journalist, making them one of the most significant articles in any conference)/Dest[13 0 R/Fit]/Parent 1508 0 R>>
endobj

1654 0 obj
<</Title(REVIEW  JOURNALISM)/Dest[13 0 R/Fit]/Parent 6 0 R/Prev 1508 0 R/First 1751 0 R/Last 1751 0 R/Count -1/Next 1752 0 R>>
endobj

1655 0 obj
<</Title(ARTICLE SPECIFIC GUIDELINES)/Dest[28 0 R/Fit]/Parent 6 0 R/Prev 1753 0 R/First 1754 0 R/Last 1755 0 R/Count -4/Next 1509 0 R>>
endobj

1656 0 obj
<</Title(When referring to any UN Member State or Observer, UN recognized name of the country should be used. These names must match those with which each nation signed the UN Charter. for eg- North Korea is recognized as "The Democratic People's Republic of Korea.)/Dest[29 0 R/Fit]/Parent 1509 0 R/Next 1756 0 R>>
endobj

1657 0 obj
<</Title(Acronyms can only be used after their full forms have been specified earlier in the  article.)/Dest[29 0 R/Fit]/Parent 1509 0 R/Prev 1756 0 R>>
endobj

1658 0 obj
<</Title(Reporters must refrain from writing articles based on personal biases and should strive to produce neutral and unbiased reports.)/Dest[29 0 R/Fit]/Parent 1382 0 R/Prev 1510 0 R/Next 1659 0 R>>
endobj

1659 0 obj
<</Title(PRESS CORPS)/Dest[29 0 R/Fit]/Parent 1382 0 R/Prev 1658 0 R/First 1757 0 R/Last 1758 0 R/Count -2/Next 1511 0 R>>
endobj

1660 0 obj
<</Title(Reporters are expected to abide by the policy of their designated news agency.)/Dest[30 0 R/Fit]/Parent 1511 0 R/Next 1759 0 R>>
endobj

1661 0 obj
<</Title(Taking notes during committee proceedings is a must, so that these can be referenced in articles.)/Dest[30 0 R/Fit]/Parent 1511 0 R/Prev 1759 0 R>>
endobj

1662 0 obj
<</Title(Any form of plagiarism or help from generative AI is strictly prohibited. If reports are found to be plagiarized or taken out of AI Bots, the guilty shall be disqualified.)/Dest[30 0 R/Fit]/Parent 1383 0 R/Prev 1512 0 R/Next 1760 0 R>>
endobj

1663 0 obj
<</Title(Additionally, an extension of the deadline will only be allowed at the discretion of the Head of Journalism and the Editor-in-Chief.)/Dest[30 0 R/Fit]/Parent 1383 0 R/Prev 1760 0 R/Next 1513 0 R>>
endobj

