1751 0 obj
<</Title(Review Journalism is a combination of both opinions and facts. It is a report/article on a specific topic which also includes the reporter's perspective and opinions. It has its disposition essence. This type of journalism retains the essence of both personal opinion and objectivity, providing readers with a dual view that incorporates factual information alongside the journalist's viewpoint.)/Dest[13 0 R/Fit]/Parent 1654 0 R>>
