<</Title(WRITING STYLE AND FORMAT)/Dest[29 0 R/Fit]/Parent 1655 0 R/Prev 1819 0 R>>
endobj

1756 0 obj
<</Title(If the delegate is representing a person, they should be referred solely to the person they are representing. For example, the diplomat representing Rahul Gandhi will be referred to simply as Rahul Gandhi, not as \217the delegate of Rahul Gandhi\220.)/Dest[29 0 R/Fit]/Parent 1509 0 R/Prev 1656 0 R/Next 1657 0 R>>
endobj

