<</Title(Misinformation is not, however, restricted to only individuals on social media, for it is controlled largely by state-owned media. The conflict for Chinese state-owned media meant leaning into using the crisis to scapegoat Washington as the driver for the conflict and all instability in the Middle East, sidelining the tragic news of four Chinese nationals getting killed, six getting injured, and two going missing due to them, something that received little attention online.)/Dest[21 0 R/Fit]/Parent 1858 0 R/Prev 1887 0 R/Next 1913 0 R>>
endobj

