1914 0 obj
<</Title(To say that there is much to tackle the spread of propaganda and misinformation in this generation of readily available 'information' is hard to say. But, if we can do anything, it is to become aware of how to spot misinformation. A simple way is to follow the methodology to to y to conduct open-source research, as prescribed by Human Rights Watch - Discover, Document, Preserve, Verify, and Analyze. It may seem brittle, but so does propaganda for the one who ably recognizes)/Dest[21 0 R/Fit]/Parent 1858 0 R/Prev 1913 0 R/Next 1902 0 R>>
endobj

